  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row13Member">㈱ＫＡＮＳＯテクノス</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row14Member">関電サ－ビス㈱</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row15Member">㈱オプテージ</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row16Member">関電コミュニティ㈱</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row17Member">関西レコードマネジメント㈱</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
